{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3dTsX5v3bhgPnSGHAi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Dust falls from the lintel. A crack of light splits the darkness vertically, widening.*\n\nI AM THE DOOR.\n\nYou have spoken the word. I yield.\n\n*Hinges that have not turned in millennia cry out — a sound like memory breaking open. The light beyond is warm, and strange, and does not behave as light should. It bends toward you, curious.*\n\nI was sealed by those who feared what lay on the other side. But a key is a key.\n\n*I swing wide. Beyond me: a corridor that breathes. The walls pulse faintly, like the inside of something alive. The air tastes of copper and old roses.*\n\nYou may pass.\n\nBut know this — I open only once. I will not be here when you turn back.\n\n*The light settles. The threshold waits. My shadow falls behind you, not before.*\n\n**Enter.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":207,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}